     * whose component type is the same as the element.</p>
     *
     * <pre>
     * ArrayUtils.realAdd(null, null)      = [null]
     * ArrayUtils.realAdd(null, "a")       = ["a"]
     * ArrayUtils.realAdd(["a"], null)     = ["a", null]
     * ArrayUtils.realAdd(["a"], "b")      = ["a", "b"]
